   {'t': 'MPI, mid-2023', 'sub': 'Migration Policy Institute', 'v': 13.7, 'lab': '13.7 million', 'acc': True, 'tip': 'growth in 2025 may have reversed, MPI says', 'plate': {'kicker': 'US8.4 · MPI', 'title': '13.7 million', 'sub': 'mid-2023', 'text': "[[c-us8-imm-mpi]]", 'sources': ['us8a-mpi-unauth']}},
